WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.484 --> 00:00:05.442
Quaesito comes with about 2,700 ready-made questions, in 14 categories.

2
00:00:05.944 --> 00:00:09.384
Pick a category, then a topic, to see just those questions.

3
00:00:10.684 --> 00:00:14.935
Search them, and filter by difficulty, question type, or where they come from.

4
00:00:16.235 --> 00:00:20.452
Found a mistake? Fix it right here, or report it with one click.

5
00:00:21.753 --> 00:00:26.483
Starting a quiz? Fill it with random questions from the categories you like.

6
00:00:29.451 --> 00:00:34.123
Your own questions can join the library too, and stay in step with your quizzes.

7
00:00:35.437 --> 00:00:39.604
Less time writing, more time playing. Happy quizzing!
